# Backhouse Fragrances



> Backhouse Fragrances is a gifting and home fragrance brand based in Newport Beach, California, founded in 2019 by Danielle and Taylor. Backhouse makes hand-poured candles, LIDO hand wash, a LIDO reed diffuser, and gift boxes built almost entirely from its own branded products. The brand specializes in custom corporate gifting, wedding and baby shower favors, and ready-to-give gift boxes, with products ranging from $16 custom mini candles to $139 gift boxes.



## What Backhouse Is Known For



- Gift boxes for personal and corporate gifting, with about 90% of every box made up of Backhouse's own branded products

- Custom corporate gifting with the client's logo on Backhouse packaging, shipped to one address or directly to each recipient

- Custom Mini Candles ($16) for weddings, baby showers, corporate events, and brand activations

- LIDO, the bestselling signature scent, available as a candle, hand wash, and reed diffuser

- Candles designed in Newport Beach and hand-poured at the Backhouse studio in Costa Mesa, California, using a natural coconut wax blend, phthalate-free fragrance oils, and lead-free wicks

- Orders packaged and shipped from the Backhouse warehouse in Costa Mesa, California

- A black-and-white, typographic, design-led brand aesthetic

- Covered by press including the Wall Street Journal, Real Simple, and C Magazine



