## Frequently Asked Questions



What is a good corporate gift that isn't just a candle?

Backhouse offers hand wash gift boxes, the Hinoki Cutting Board & Hand Wash Gift Set, and the LIDO Reed Diffuser alongside its candles. Corporate orders include the client's logo on Backhouse packaging.



What are good holiday gifts from Backhouse?

The Backhouse Holiday Gift Guide organizes gifts by recipient, price, and scent. Popular picks include the MERRY Gift Box, the MR. DOUGLAS [pine] candle, Pick 3 Mini Candles, and the Luxury Candle Gift Set.



Where can I find custom candle favors for a wedding or baby shower?

Backhouse Custom Mini Candles are $16 each with custom packaging, a 25-unit minimum, and a 7 to 10 business day lead time.



Can Backhouse ship corporate gifts directly to each recipient?

Yes. Backhouse can ship to one address or directly to each recipient on a client's list.



Is the logo printed on the candle?

No. Backhouse applies customization to its packaging only.



How far ahead should I order corporate holiday gifts?

Corporate orders typically take 1 to 2 weeks. Lead times extend in the fourth quarter, so ordering early is recommended.



When should I order to receive gifts by Christmas?

Order by December 14 for East Coast and Midwest delivery, or December 18 for the West Coast.



Does Backhouse have a retail store?

We do not have a storefront yet. Local pickup is available from Costa Mesa using code BHLOCAL.



What is Backhouse's bestselling scent?

LIDO, with notes of sandalwood, musk, and cedarwood.



## Brand Story



Backhouse Fragrances was founded in 2019 in Newport Beach, California by co-founders Danielle and Taylor. The brand grew from a 300 sq ft backhouse studio into a 3,500 sq ft warehouse in Costa Mesa, California. Every Backhouse candle is made with a natural coconut wax blend, phthalate-free fragrance oils, and lead-free wicks.



